{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/13118","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/13118/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/13118/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/13118/events","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/13118","id":192025117,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxOTIwMjUxMTc=","number":13118,"title":"ContentChild(TemplateRef) descendants not working on init phase","user":{"login":"kukjevov","id":16702037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NzAyMDM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16702037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kukjevov","html_url":"https://github.com/kukjevov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kukjevov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kukjevov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kukjevov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kukjevov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kukjevov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kukjevov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kukjevov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kukjevov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kukjevov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":130606843,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzA2MDY4NDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/type:%20bug/fix","name":"type: bug/fix","color":"EEEEEE","default":false,"description":null},{"id":375497160,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzU0OTcxNjA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/freq2:%20medium","name":"freq2: medium","color":"fbca04","default":false,"description":null},{"id":375501288,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzU1MDEyODg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/labels/area:%20core","name":"area: core","color":"c7def8","default":false,"description":"Issues related to the framework runtime"}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2016-11-28T14:51:13Z","updated_at":"2019-09-10T13:20:44Z","closed_at":"2016-12-28T00:28:54Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**I'm submitting a ...**  (check one with \"x\")\r\n```\r\n[x] bug report => search github for a similar issue or PR before submitting\r\n[ ] feature request\r\n[ ] support request => Please do not submit support request here, instead see https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#question\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Current behavior**\r\n<!-- Describe how the bug manifests. -->\r\nCurrently when you have `ContentChild(TemplateRef)` it is not working correctly. Because after init you get different TemplateRef object as you get after another ContentCheck. \r\n\r\nIf you have following html\r\n```html\r\n<grabber>\r\n    <template>\r\n        <div style=\"background-color: #FF00FF;\">\r\n            <span>ok</span>\r\n            <div style=\"background-color: #00FFFF;\" *ngIf=\"true\">bad</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </template>\r\n</grabber>\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf your `grabber` component have `@ContentChild(TemplateRef)` and in `ngAfterContentInit()` method you will use this template, `<template>` element is used.\r\n\r\nBut if you use this template again, not during `ngAfterContentInit()` method call you get `<div style=\"background-color: #00FFFF;\" *ngIf=\"true\">bad</div>` template.\r\n\r\nThis is pretty awfull bug. \r\nThanks for help\r\n\r\n**Expected behavior**\r\n<!-- Describe what the behavior would be without the bug. -->\r\nIt should return same template during init phase and also after another check of content. And also there is no explaination why `descendants: true` were set. This means that correct template in this case is div? If so, then during init phase this is not considered.\r\n\r\n**Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions**\r\nHere is plunker where you can see problem described above. https://plnkr.co/edit/FWqPGlsENMJZHhD4SOCd?p=preview\r\n\r\nIf you add another template you see only `<div>` element.\r\n\r\n**What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?**\r\n<!-- Describe the motivation or the concrete use case -->\r\n\r\n**Please tell us about your environment:**\r\n<!-- Operating system, IDE, package manager, HTTP server, ... -->\r\nWindows 10, Visual Studio Code, npm, Connect server\r\n\r\n* **Angular version:** >= 2.2.0\r\n<!-- Check whether this is still an issue in the most recent Angular version -->\r\n\r\n* **Browser:** all\r\n<!-- All browsers where this could be reproduced -->\r\n \r\n* **Language:** TypeScript 2.0.9\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"hansl","id":681969,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTk2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/681969?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansl","html_url":"https://github.com/hansl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hansl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://a